@startuml
left to right direction

actor "Process Analyst" as Analyst
actor "Finance Manager" as Manager
actor "DevOps Engineer" as DevOps

rectangle "TravelPay Streaming\nProcess Mining Platform" {
  usecase "Monitor live\nreimbursement process" as UC_Monitor
  usecase "Ask NL questions\nabout process" as UC_NLQ
  usecase "Explain BPMN\nmodel in natural language" as UC_Explain
  usecase "Recommend\nwindow & decay size" as UC_Tune
  usecase "Summarize\nanomalies & SLA breaches" as UC_Alerts
}

Analyst --> UC_Monitor
Analyst --> UC_NLQ
Analyst --> UC_Explain
Analyst --> UC_Tune

Manager --> UC_Alerts
Manager --> UC_Explain

DevOps --> UC_Tune

UC_NLQ ..> UC_Explain : <<includes>>
UC_Tune ..> UC_Monitor : <<uses>>

@enduml